      "translation": "Marten Deinum，Arjen Poutsma",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The returned request can be written to, and then executed by calling\n<a href=\"ClientHttpRequest.html#execute()\"><code>ClientHttpRequest.execute()</code></a>.",
